Subject: [PATCH 8/8] fix(test): replace @MockBean with stub in
 BusinessControllerTest

Mockito inline mocks fail on Java 26 (Byte Buddy cannot instrument
CreateBusinessService). Use a hand-written StubCreateBusinessService
subclass instead so the controller slice test runs on JDK 21+.
